s:386:"Please note: This page layout is limited by Moodle core in such a way that blocks cannot be added directly on the page. However, as soon as you enable a block region here, <a href="https://docs.moodle.org/en/Block_settings#Making_a_block_sticky_throughout_the_whole_site" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">site-wide sticky blocks</a> will still be displayed on this page layout.";